WEBVTT

00:08.708 --> 00:16.750
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.750 --> 00:24.748
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.265 --> 00:36.069
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.069 --> 00:39.072
Believing, dreaming

00:39.072 --> 00:42.909
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:42.909 --> 00:48.040
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.849 --> 00:58.258
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.258 --> 01:02.829
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.829 --> 01:05.498
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.498 --> 01:13.773
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.773 --> 01:18.733
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.280 --> 01:26.913
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:54.380 --> 01:56.007
What now?

01:56.382 --> 01:58.509
Do you have a new prediction for me?

02:10.163 --> 02:15.829
The 22nd Night
The Goddesses' Reality

02:18.404 --> 02:22.898
Enough already. Set them free, Odin.

02:27.113 --> 02:28.748
I see.

02:28.748 --> 02:30.545
In that case, I'll do it.

02:45.098 --> 02:47.726
Where are you going, Skuld?

02:49.636 --> 02:52.002
We won't know if you don't tell us.

02:53.039 --> 02:54.438
Skuld?

02:55.475 --> 02:58.933
I can't find the answer.

02:59.279 --> 03:00.746
The answer?

03:01.047 --> 03:03.015
This is about Lord Loki, isn't it?

03:04.517 --> 03:08.248
I don't believe it.
You've fallen for the enemy?

03:08.955 --> 03:11.719
Is he really our enemy?

03:15.161 --> 03:18.831
Tell me, big sister Verdandi:

03:18.831 --> 03:22.335
Is Lord Loki really our enemy?

03:22.335 --> 03:25.463
Is he really someone we must destroy?

03:25.972 --> 03:27.462
Skuld...

03:28.308 --> 03:31.778
It seems a little rest would do you good.

03:31.778 --> 03:32.938
Very well.

03:33.646 --> 03:36.877
Verdandi and I will handle
the next operation.

03:39.719 --> 03:42.589
You understand, don't you Skuld?

03:42.589 --> 03:46.548
What you are saying is
treasonous to Lord Odin.

03:49.662 --> 03:52.465
You're just tired. Get some sleep.

03:52.465 --> 03:54.092
I'm sorry.

04:01.708 --> 04:03.335
A visitor?

04:08.314 --> 04:12.182
Won't you open up?
I want to speak with you.

04:24.664 --> 04:26.564
Daddy!

04:28.801 --> 04:30.270
Daddy!

04:30.270 --> 04:32.372
Where did you go?

04:32.372 --> 04:34.507
Come back, Daddy!

04:34.507 --> 04:36.743
Stop it, Brother.

04:36.743 --> 04:39.012
You'll make the neighbors angry.

04:39.012 --> 04:41.114
That's wight. You'll bothor them.

04:41.114 --> 04:44.641
Shut the hell up. I'm worried about Daddy.

04:46.252 --> 04:47.487
Daddy!

04:47.487 --> 04:48.955
All this howling...

04:48.955 --> 04:51.549
You've become a dog through and through!

04:52.725 --> 04:54.394
Okay, I'll be back.

04:54.394 --> 04:55.728
Master Loki!

04:55.728 --> 04:57.696
Where will you be going?

04:58.064 --> 05:01.033
I'll be back soon. Don't worry.

05:03.269 --> 05:04.337
Daddy!

05:04.337 --> 05:07.307
Wrong. Master Loki doesn't ring the bell.

05:07.307 --> 05:09.275
Oh, right. Then who is it?

05:09.942 --> 05:11.110
Hey there!

05:11.110 --> 05:14.280
My dad's family back home
sent us some potatoes!

05:14.280 --> 05:15.645
Here, you guys have some!

05:16.349 --> 05:18.184
It's just that dimwitted girl, huh?

05:18.184 --> 05:19.285
Big brother!

05:19.285 --> 05:20.553
Huh? What is it?

05:20.553 --> 05:23.113
Ah, nothing! It's a long story.

05:23.389 --> 05:27.792
That's right. Mayura can't hear
what Fenrir says.

05:27.994 --> 05:30.519
Huh? Hey, where's Loki?

05:43.943 --> 05:46.104
I appreciate the warm welcome.

05:52.552 --> 05:55.715
Jeez, Loki wasn't even there? What a drag.

05:56.656 --> 05:57.824
Here ya go.

05:57.824 --> 05:59.459
Ah, here it is.

05:59.459 --> 06:01.828
Well, look at this.
It's fish cakes, your favorite.

06:01.828 --> 06:05.127
Eat up now, Heimdall.

06:06.466 --> 06:07.763
Frey...

06:12.071 --> 06:14.130
Have a little consideration, dammit!

06:15.875 --> 06:17.377
There you go.

06:17.377 --> 06:20.175
Thor, let me have one more of those.

06:20.246 --> 06:20.646
Oden Stew

06:20.646 --> 06:22.148
Oden Stew
Comin' right up.

06:22.148 --> 06:25.811
Oden Stew

06:56.516 --> 06:57.983
Loki.

07:04.991 --> 07:06.151
Loki.

07:14.000 --> 07:16.628
I'm impressed that you found our mansion.

07:20.673 --> 07:22.868
I followed Skuld's presence.

07:23.209 --> 07:25.837
Unfortunately, Skuld is not here.

07:26.212 --> 07:28.840
We'd be glad to take a message for her.

07:29.282 --> 07:31.978
I came here to see the two of you.

07:36.722 --> 07:39.691
There's something I want to
talk to you about.

07:53.673 --> 07:59.345
If you desire a word with us,
please step through the gate.

07:59.345 --> 08:00.710
Fine.

08:06.052 --> 08:08.654
That form is much more handsome.

08:08.654 --> 08:10.781
Please have a seat.

08:19.932 --> 08:22.662
Well then, let us hear what you have to say.

08:24.370 --> 08:26.338
Smells nice.

08:26.839 --> 08:29.307
Is Odin doing all right?

08:41.354 --> 08:43.481
I have lost my way.

08:43.789 --> 08:46.993
I am but a shadow of myself,
wandering aimlessly.

08:46.993 --> 08:50.952
Guide me, that I may find my true purpose.

08:51.631 --> 08:53.565
Hear me, Urdarbrunnr.

09:01.541 --> 09:06.045
Why are you all, or rather,
why is Odin trying to kill me?

09:06.045 --> 09:09.310
As I told you before, it is for
the sake of the future.

09:09.515 --> 09:12.780
Are you saying that I am
a threat to the future?

09:13.119 --> 09:18.284
Lord Odin acquired Heimdall's eye,
and saw it for himself.

09:18.457 --> 09:23.563
The moment when a single god steals the life
from every living thing on this world

09:23.563 --> 09:25.929
and obliterates all hope.

09:26.666 --> 09:28.133
Ragnarok.

09:31.704 --> 09:34.434
And do you believe that?

09:34.707 --> 09:36.868
Do you trust Odin's words?

09:38.444 --> 09:42.114
Well, Urd? Verdandi?

09:42.114 --> 09:43.816
A silly question.

09:43.816 --> 09:47.616
It is because we believe him
that we have come here.

09:48.554 --> 09:51.921
I see. Then it's no use.

09:52.558 --> 09:55.628
If you truly believe what you say.

09:55.628 --> 09:57.530
What do you mean?

09:57.530 --> 10:00.090
I don't understand what you are saying.

10:00.433 --> 10:05.063
The Norn I know are the goddesses of fate.

10:05.871 --> 10:08.431
They are gentle and pure of heart.

10:08.908 --> 10:11.468
They would never hurt anyone.

10:11.577 --> 10:13.977
What do you all think you're doing?

10:18.417 --> 10:20.442
Do not make light of us!

10:20.720 --> 10:22.449
Please leave.

10:23.189 --> 10:25.691
I am not finished speaking.

10:25.691 --> 10:28.660
There is nothing more to say.

10:44.710 --> 10:47.679
Please tell me, Urdarbrunnr.

10:48.381 --> 10:51.584
I have a feeling that the person
I am now isn't the real me.

10:51.584 --> 10:53.753
My chest feels like it will burst open.

10:53.753 --> 10:57.985
Let me see myself! My true self!

10:58.557 --> 11:00.525
Is that your wish?

11:01.160 --> 11:03.754
You want to meet your true self?

11:04.296 --> 11:06.491
I do... I do!

11:07.199 --> 11:10.770
Then is the person you are now a lie?

11:10.770 --> 11:12.905
That's how I feel.

11:12.905 --> 11:14.270
Why?

11:14.740 --> 11:18.267
Because I have such doubts over our mission.

11:18.611 --> 11:21.910
I don't want to take up arms
against Lord Loki.

11:24.283 --> 11:25.785
I...

11:25.785 --> 11:28.754
I've realized my true feelings for him!

11:29.855 --> 11:31.322
Unfortunate.

11:32.892 --> 11:35.019
This is most unfortunate, Skuld.

11:36.228 --> 11:39.994
I had thought you were more
obedient than this.

11:40.733 --> 11:42.701
You're not Urdarbrunnr.

11:43.235 --> 11:44.634
Who are you?!

11:44.870 --> 11:47.771
I have no further use for you.

12:07.093 --> 12:11.826
This is Ragnarok, a world in
the grip of despair.

12:12.665 --> 12:18.501
We will protect the future, as we are the
goddesses who know what is to come.

12:18.871 --> 12:20.372
Open your eyes!

12:20.372 --> 12:22.499
Urd! Verdandi!

12:22.942 --> 12:25.410
That is enough, Lord Loki.

12:32.952 --> 12:35.750
Is it painful, Lord Loki?

12:36.989 --> 12:39.685
This is an illusion.

12:40.926 --> 12:44.130
The realm of the illusory is
governed by the mind.

12:44.130 --> 12:50.160
Here, one can experience greater pain
than that of any physical injury.

12:55.875 --> 13:00.505
I will take your life for the
future of all creation.

13:04.717 --> 13:06.014
No!

13:19.565 --> 13:20.862
Skuld!

13:21.133 --> 13:24.762
Don't hurt Lord Loki.

13:25.070 --> 13:27.402
What in the world happened to you?

13:30.810 --> 13:34.146
Urd... Verdandi...

13:34.146 --> 13:36.114
We were wrong.

13:39.819 --> 13:42.117
We were wrong.

13:43.489 --> 13:45.116
Skuld! Skuld!

13:45.424 --> 13:50.054
This is his answer to you all.

13:54.433 --> 13:55.900
Poor thing.

13:58.404 --> 14:01.407
Stop this! You're behind this, aren't you?

14:01.407 --> 14:04.205
You had your friends do this to Skuld!

14:04.610 --> 14:06.077
It wasn't me.

14:07.012 --> 14:10.583
There is no reason Lord Odin would betray us!

14:10.583 --> 14:12.483
I'm certain of it!

14:15.221 --> 14:16.688
Verdandi...

14:19.925 --> 14:21.552
The rose myrtle.

14:22.294 --> 14:25.752
Lord Odin, what is the meaning of this?

14:26.065 --> 14:27.430
Please answer.

14:28.267 --> 14:29.734
Lord Odin!

14:30.736 --> 14:33.364
It's as Loki said, Norn.

14:36.976 --> 14:39.274
You have failed.

14:41.213 --> 14:43.010
You are of no further use to me.

14:44.049 --> 14:45.551
Who are you?

14:45.551 --> 14:47.178
A new assassin?!

15:16.448 --> 15:18.006
The mansion...

15:53.719 --> 15:56.620
It's no use. You don't stand
a chance in that form.

15:58.257 --> 16:01.624
You can die here along with the Norn.

16:06.699 --> 16:08.166
Get out of here!

16:17.609 --> 16:19.042
What is this?

16:21.313 --> 16:22.780
What's going on?!

16:23.315 --> 16:24.839
An evil power?

16:25.117 --> 16:27.585
Such powerful energy.

16:29.355 --> 16:30.879
Daddy is in there.

16:31.256 --> 16:32.524
What?
What did you say?
What was that?

16:32.524 --> 16:33.592
Master Loki!

16:33.592 --> 16:34.388
Four-Eyes!

16:37.429 --> 16:39.090
Four-Eyes! Are you all right?

16:40.299 --> 16:42.267
I'm all right.

16:47.773 --> 16:49.070
The mansion!

16:51.143 --> 16:52.201
Master Loki.

16:53.045 --> 16:54.512
Master Loki!

17:02.921 --> 17:04.081
This way!

17:26.612 --> 17:27.909
The exit!

17:30.682 --> 17:31.917
Enough.

17:31.917 --> 17:33.118
Don't give up!

17:33.118 --> 17:35.416
But all our exits are gone!

17:37.122 --> 17:39.056
Resigned to your fate, I see.

17:56.308 --> 17:57.775
Veil Lubadrock!

18:07.686 --> 18:09.153
It's no use.

18:17.029 --> 18:18.063
Big sister...

18:18.063 --> 18:19.690
Skuld... Verdandi...

18:21.834 --> 18:23.569
Suffer, Loki!

18:23.569 --> 18:25.799
I won't let you die so easily!

18:27.206 --> 18:29.902
You will suffer before you die.

18:30.309 --> 18:31.742
Who are you?

18:32.010 --> 18:33.637
We're doomed.

18:34.113 --> 18:36.411
This is our fate.

18:37.349 --> 18:41.251
I'm sorry, Lord Loki. We were mistaken.

18:41.520 --> 18:43.044
Big sister...

18:43.388 --> 18:46.016
Please forgive us for what we've done.

18:46.892 --> 18:48.360
Pitiful, aren't we?

18:48.360 --> 18:52.990
To think that the goddesses of fate
should themselves be the pawns of fate.

18:58.704 --> 19:01.172
This isn't fate at all.

19:03.275 --> 19:04.776
Pull yourselves together!

19:04.776 --> 19:06.903
How could the goddesses of fate just give in?!

19:13.919 --> 19:16.388
Fate isn't something you accept:

19:16.388 --> 19:18.754
It's something you grasp with your own hands!

19:26.031 --> 19:28.556
This is not the end.

19:42.948 --> 19:43.744
What?!

19:51.190 --> 19:52.748
Why you...

19:55.394 --> 19:56.562
Master Loki!

19:56.562 --> 19:57.688
Daddy!

20:08.273 --> 20:09.240
Master Loki!

20:39.738 --> 20:41.296
Master Loki...

20:41.807 --> 20:44.503
I'm glad you're safe.

20:55.721 --> 20:57.518
It's all right now.

20:58.757 --> 21:01.954
Daddy, what was all that anyway?

21:05.931 --> 21:09.059
I sensed intense hatred in that energy field.

21:09.835 --> 21:11.632
But whose could it have been?

21:15.007 --> 21:17.576
I won't let you die a peaceful death.

21:17.576 --> 21:20.101
You will suffer before you die.

21:22.681 --> 21:23.978
Loki!

21:53.612 --> 21:56.911
Loki, I swear that you will fall by my hand.

22:16.902 --> 22:28.871
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.549 --> 22:42.294
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.294 --> 22:49.501
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.501 --> 22:55.841
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.841 --> 23:05.350
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.350 --> 23:09.688
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.688 --> 23:21.700
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.700 --> 23:23.429
Believe in Heaven

23:31.309 --> 23:32.511
Next Episode

23:32.511 --> 23:35.814
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"girls," "the lake" and "outdoor spa."

23:35.814 --> 23:38.784
Next Episode
Hey, Skuld, oink, did you know that
pigs like to keep things clean?

23:38.784 --> 23:40.419
Next Episode
Is that right, Mayura?

23:40.419 --> 23:42.320
Next Episode
Say, Mayura, have you put on some weight?

23:42.320 --> 23:45.457
Next Episode
Oink, why not at all! I'm just the
same as always! Woo-hoo!

23:45.457 --> 23:48.126
Next Episode
Hey, have you always had
such a round nose?

23:48.126 --> 23:50.829
Next Episode
It hasn't changed since the day
I was born! Oink! Woo-hoo!

23:50.829 --> 23:52.964
Next Episode
Is that right? Well, silly me!

23:52.964 --> 23:55.033
Next Episode
Ah-ha ha ha ha ha!

23:55.033 --> 23:55.600
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.600 --> 23:56.401
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.401 --> 23:56.501
The 23rd Night
Summer Girl of the Lake
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.501 --> 23:58.003
The 23rd Night
Summer Girl of the Lake
"Summer Girl of the Lake"

23:58.003 --> 24:01.006
The 23rd Night
Summer Girl of the Lake
Sounds like another strange mystery, oink.
